    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the public health law, in relation to designating certain substances as schedule I or schedule II opiates; and to amend the penal law, in relation to the sale of preparations, compounds mixtures and substances containing heroin and an opiate",
    "basePrintNo": "S6632",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6632-2015",
